pve-storage-gdrive (0.5.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Add per-storage write_bwlimit (cgroup v2 io.max) throttling and automatic
    cache-overflow backpressure so local writes match upload bandwidth.
  * Tune rclone VFS caching (--dir-cache-time 30m, --vfs-fast-fingerprint,
    --drive-chunk-size 64M, --vfs-cache-max-age 10m, --vfs-cache-poll-interval 15s).
  * Fix Proxmox VE 9.x ExtJS API2Request /api2/extjs routing, ContentView
    callParent chain, Shared Drive combobox sentinel value, and rclone --rc-addr.
  * Add debian/postrm to cleanly restart PVE services after uninstall.

 -- Proxmox GDrive Contributors <maintainers@lipa.run>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:10:00 +0100

pve-storage-gdrive (0.1.0-2) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Rework Google authentication to support simple one-time OAuth2 login in
    the CLI (`pve-gdrive login` and during `local_install.sh` / `install.sh`)
    and Web UI without requiring Service Account IAM or Google Cloud setup.
  * Fix HTTP 501 on /gdrive/* API routes by registering PVE::API2::GDrive in
    PVE/API2.pm via overlay-hook.sh, marking IPC routes protected => 1 so
    pveproxy forwards to pvedaemon, and bumping MAX_APIVER for PVE 9.x.

 -- Proxmox GDrive Contributors <maintainers@lipa.run>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:54:00 +0000

pve-storage-gdrive (0.1.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

